+`meetings.tenant_id` and `meetings.owner_user_id` are explicitly source-system
+identifiers. They are never assumed equal to `tenants.id` or `users.id`.
+Backfill must first resolve the active tenant mapping, then the exact active
+source pair `(meetings.tenant_id, meetings.owner_user_id)`, then verify the
+mapped internal user is currently active in the mapped internal tenant. A
+provider subject resolves only through `user_auth_identities` to that internal
+user; it never substitutes for either source key. Zero, multiple, revoked, or
+cross-tenant results quarantine the meeting.
+
