+origin and source column has no default and remains NULL in A2. Named dormant
+CHECK constraints reject every non-NULL derivative origin/source combination;
+PR B must deliberately drop those checks in the same migration that adds atomic
+propagation and enforcement. This makes accidental pre-enforcement writes fail
+at the database boundary rather than create an authorization bypass.
+
+### Nullable quarantine and fail-closed memory barrier
+
+For each pre-existing meeting, the only allowed post-backfill states are:
+
+| State | Stored meeting origin | Meaning |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| linked | previously NULL pair becomes non-NULL | every mapping, actor, conversation, and membership invariant passed atomically |
+| already linked | same valid non-NULL pair retained | idempotent no-op after full revalidation |
+| quarantined unlinked | both fields NULL | one fixed reason code recorded; no partial write or grant |
+| quarantined linked | existing non-NULL pair retained unchanged | a current invariant failed on rerun; report only, never clear/repoint/reactivate/escalate |
+
+There is no unknown partial state: the pair-nullability check rejects it. A new
+link transaction either sets both columns or leaves both NULL. A rerun never
+rewrites an existing pair; it reports a now-invalid pair as quarantined linked,
+and later current-state authorization still denies it. Derivative tables are not
+classified or backfilled; every new derivative field remains NULL and is
+covered by its dormant CHECK.
+
+`memory_visibility` remains byte-for-byte `private|org`; A2 does not add a
+`conversation` enum value. Defense in depth is mandatory: every existing memory
+read/update/chain/search query adds `access_conversation_id IS NULL`, and a
+direct lookup of a non-NULL conversation-origin row returns the same public
+`not_found`/empty-lane response as an absent row. Thus an inconsistent row
+introduced outside the supported runner is quarantined from all current memory
+surfaces. PR B may remove this barrier only when caller-aware conversation
+membership enforcement lands atomically.
 
